WEBVTT

00:00:01.640 --> 00:00:04.060
An intermingling of repeated wishes...

00:00:04.310 --> 00:00:06.400
Two destinies intertwining...

00:00:06.810 --> 00:00:10.320
Long, long ago, in the 
land of the rising sun,

00:00:10.320 --> 00:00:12.820
the gods held a festival to

00:00:12.820 --> 00:00:16.320
choose twelve divine messengers  
to protect the newborn land.

00:00:17.000 --> 00:00:19.640
However, due to the Rat's trickery,

00:00:19.640 --> 00:00:22.450
the Cat was not able to 
participate in the festival

00:00:22.450 --> 00:00:25.020
and could not become part of the zodiac.

00:00:26.890 --> 00:00:28.090
Now, two thousand years later,

00:00:28.510 --> 00:00:32.320
the Cat and Rat are 
about to begin their final battle,

00:00:32.620 --> 00:00:35.830
each for her own reasons and feelings.

00:00:37.180 --> 00:00:38.220
Etotama!

00:00:37.180 --> 00:00:39.300
<b>Cat</b>

00:00:39.300 --> 00:00:41.310
Sol/Lull Charge!

00:01:00.160 --> 00:01:04.710
<b>ETOTAMA</b>

00:02:24.160 --> 00:02:28.370
<b>Episode 12: Eto in Full Bloom</b>

00:02:29.220 --> 00:02:30.740
Are Nya-tan's memories...?

00:02:31.190 --> 00:02:33.130
She said she remembered everything.

00:02:34.180 --> 00:02:34.880
<i>Nya-tan...</i>

00:02:49.080 --> 00:02:51.820
Chu-tan!

00:03:25.340 --> 00:03:27.720
You call this getting serious?!

00:03:34.380 --> 00:03:37.230
Here we go!

00:03:51.190 --> 00:03:52.960
This time,

00:03:53.350 --> 00:03:56.040
I will destroy your Etotama completely!

00:03:58.980 --> 00:04:00.130
What?

00:04:02.570 --> 00:04:03.330
That's...

00:04:03.330 --> 00:04:06.010
The same Kagura Senguu that Chu-tan used.

00:04:06.010 --> 00:04:08.010
Why is Nya-tan...?

00:04:15.440 --> 00:04:16.860
I never dreamed

00:04:17.310 --> 00:04:19.860
that you would learn this technique, too.

00:04:19.860 --> 00:04:21.030
I didn't!

00:04:22.440 --> 00:04:25.530
The first one to ever use 
Etotama Kagura Senguu...

00:04:25.860 --> 00:04:26.530
Was me!

00:04:27.200 --> 00:04:28.030
<b>Rat</b>

00:04:28.270 --> 00:04:29.260
What are...

00:04:30.280 --> 00:04:31.260
...you saying?

00:04:32.290 --> 00:04:33.480
Chu-tan.

00:04:34.600 --> 00:04:37.420
You're more direct and 
up-front than anyone.

00:04:37.420 --> 00:04:40.210
You won't even throw away 
the negative emotions

00:04:40.430 --> 00:04:43.350
that keep piling up in you. 
You accept them fully.

00:04:44.380 --> 00:04:47.890
So by the time I realized it...

00:04:48.790 --> 00:04:52.740
The Sol/Lull in you had 
already started rampaging.

00:04:53.230 --> 00:04:56.110
I had no other choice!

00:04:58.050 --> 00:05:01.420
There were already signs 
of her rampage even then?

00:05:01.420 --> 00:05:04.660
For the sake of humanity, 
and for this land,

00:05:05.180 --> 00:05:06.160
and...

00:05:07.120 --> 00:05:09.050
To serve as an example for us,

00:05:09.370 --> 00:05:12.870
Chu-tan always remained a 
strong, unyielding leader.

00:05:13.830 --> 00:05:17.400
She was genuine to a fault.

00:05:18.290 --> 00:05:20.620
That's why she was unable to escape 
the evil stirring within her,

00:05:20.620 --> 00:05:22.410
and the contortion of her reason.

00:05:22.410 --> 00:05:25.990
She was trapped, no longer able to move.

00:05:26.680 --> 00:05:30.680
I-If she was so troubled, 
she could have told us.

00:05:30.680 --> 00:05:32.980
Yeah! If she'd talked to us—

00:05:32.980 --> 00:05:34.490
She couldn't do that!

00:05:34.810 --> 00:05:38.300
No. We just wouldn't let her.

00:05:41.030 --> 00:05:44.170
I dumped all kinds of trouble on her.

00:05:44.170 --> 00:05:46.210
I just made her listen to my whining...

00:05:46.210 --> 00:05:48.890
I never actually listened to her.

00:05:48.890 --> 00:05:50.820
I feel terrible.

00:05:51.100 --> 00:05:54.080
Only Nya-tan realized it.

00:05:54.080 --> 00:05:56.160
I thought she was the most 
selfish one of us all,

00:05:56.160 --> 00:05:58.990
thinking of no one but herself...

00:05:58.990 --> 00:06:00.080
That's why...

00:06:00.490 --> 00:06:03.110
That's why I went through so much training

00:06:03.110 --> 00:06:05.840
and mastered Kagura Senguu!

00:06:06.290 --> 00:06:07.800
For you, Chu-tan!

00:06:07.800 --> 00:06:10.640
What nonsense are you spouting?!

00:06:22.560 --> 00:06:26.070
Then the reason Nya-tan wanted 
to train under us...

00:06:26.070 --> 00:06:28.420
She wanted to master the

00:06:28.420 --> 00:06:30.600
secret technique, Etotama Kagura Senguu.

00:06:30.600 --> 00:06:31.700
Truly?

00:06:32.050 --> 00:06:33.530
But why?

00:06:33.850 --> 00:06:36.220
You mastered Kagura Senguu for me?

00:06:36.540 --> 00:06:37.370
<b>Rat</b>

00:06:37.640 --> 00:06:41.020
What? What is she talking about?

00:06:52.540 --> 00:06:56.350
Secret technique: Etotama Kagura Senguu!

00:07:01.470 --> 00:07:03.750
Wh-What is this technique?

00:07:04.890 --> 00:07:06.690
That's enough, Chu-tan.

00:07:07.110 --> 00:07:08.370
That's enough.

00:07:09.550 --> 00:07:12.700
You can rest now.

00:07:14.880 --> 00:07:16.720
Rest, you say?

00:07:18.070 --> 00:07:20.410
I'm in your way?

00:07:21.190 --> 00:07:23.120
You don't need me?

00:07:23.580 --> 00:07:26.420
This is the only way I can save you!

00:07:26.760 --> 00:07:28.420
Who asked you to save me?

00:07:28.720 --> 00:07:31.090
You promised me

00:07:31.090 --> 00:07:33.080
that you'd protect this land!

00:07:34.110 --> 00:07:35.100
Yet you...

00:07:35.100 --> 00:07:36.760
Don't, Chu-tan!

00:07:37.030 --> 00:07:38.190
If you do this, you'll—

00:07:38.190 --> 00:07:40.270
Quiet, cat clan Eto-musume!

00:07:40.270 --> 00:07:41.880
You are now...

00:07:42.320 --> 00:07:43.940
My enemy!

00:07:49.030 --> 00:07:49.860
No—

00:07:51.250 --> 00:07:51.900
That's...

00:07:57.240 --> 00:08:00.570
J-Just by seeing it... you 
learned Kagura Senguu?

00:08:01.460 --> 00:08:03.460
Ch-Chu-tan...

00:08:22.280 --> 00:08:25.250
Nya-tan was also capable 
of using Kagura Senguu?

00:08:25.830 --> 00:08:29.020
It appears you are all doing 
whatever you please.

00:08:32.890 --> 00:08:35.060
Everyone! What happened?

00:08:35.360 --> 00:08:36.780
Human boy...

00:08:37.860 --> 00:08:39.280
I ask of you:

00:08:40.140 --> 00:08:42.910
Do you need these zodiac spirits?

00:08:43.540 --> 00:08:45.680
Well, human boy?

00:08:45.680 --> 00:08:46.930
Manager?

00:08:53.370 --> 00:08:55.050
I finally remembered...

00:08:55.620 --> 00:08:57.860
Everything!

00:09:00.790 --> 00:09:02.900
That doesn't change anything.

00:09:03.870 --> 00:09:06.400
I will destroy you, and that is all!

00:09:06.400 --> 00:09:07.230
Kokushi...

00:09:09.650 --> 00:09:14.030
Tenchuusatsu!

00:09:14.030 --> 00:09:15.740
<b>Kokushi Tenchuusatsu</b>

00:09:18.270 --> 00:09:19.420
Now, it's time!

00:09:19.740 --> 00:09:21.410
Cat clan secret technique:

00:09:26.450 --> 00:09:31.430
Neko Masshiguran!

00:09:29.500 --> 00:09:32.590
<b>Neko Masshiguran</b>

00:09:35.760 --> 00:09:37.010
I see.

00:09:37.650 --> 00:09:41.110
So you've regained your power 
along with your memories?

00:09:43.710 --> 00:09:45.450
Not my power!

00:09:45.450 --> 00:09:48.270
What... What came back to me is...

00:09:49.090 --> 00:09:51.110
My love for you, Chu-tan!

00:10:18.470 --> 00:10:19.640
Secret technique:

00:10:19.640 --> 00:10:24.260
Etotama Kagura Senguu!

00:10:32.060 --> 00:10:37.070
<b>[Etotama Kagura Senguu] A divine act that transforms the Etotama, 
an Eto-musume's soul, into the vessel for a new soul. 
It requires special Sol/Lull and cleanses the Etotama of impurities 
without the loss of the target's memories or abilities.</b>

00:10:37.070 --> 00:10:42.070
<b>[Zodiac Precepts ~Article 0: "Power of State"] All divine 
precepts are established by the Conference of Gods, 
held by the ETM12 Executive Committee of members chosen 
by the many gods, and must be obeyed by all Eto-musume.</b>

00:10:43.330 --> 00:10:46.250
Answer me, human boy.

00:10:47.010 --> 00:10:50.470
Do humans need the zodiac spirits?

00:10:50.770 --> 00:10:53.750
If I say we don't, what then?

00:10:54.030 --> 00:10:57.460
I will invoke Article 0 
of the Zodiac Precepts.

00:10:58.710 --> 00:11:01.720
What is Article 0 of the Zodiac Precepts?

00:11:01.980 --> 00:11:04.460
The current Eto-shin will disappear,

00:11:04.460 --> 00:11:06.720
and all will be recomposed from scratch.

00:11:06.720 --> 00:11:07.600
They'll disappear?

00:11:07.600 --> 00:11:09.450
As they are now,

00:11:09.450 --> 00:11:12.320
the zodiac spirits cannot protect 
either the people or the land.

00:11:12.320 --> 00:11:15.260
They are essentially too imperfect to

00:11:15.260 --> 00:11:17.410
exist as messengers of the gods.

00:11:18.510 --> 00:11:21.000
You're asking whether humans need

00:11:21.000 --> 00:11:22.770
the zodiac spirits or not?

00:11:29.570 --> 00:11:31.980
Let go! Let go!

00:11:32.610 --> 00:11:34.970
I thought destroying it

00:11:34.970 --> 00:11:37.100
would be for your own good.

00:11:37.990 --> 00:11:40.670
I thought it was the only way to save you!

00:11:40.030 --> 00:11:42.850
Let go!

00:11:44.170 --> 00:11:47.420
But I was wrong!

00:11:48.720 --> 00:11:50.950
I just didn't know.

00:11:53.620 --> 00:11:56.380
There were so many other things

00:11:56.890 --> 00:11:59.500
I could do for the people I cared about.

00:12:05.530 --> 00:12:07.700
I'm sorry, Chu-tan.

00:12:13.070 --> 00:12:14.530
Let go!

00:12:14.880 --> 00:12:16.540
Don't touch me!

00:12:16.540 --> 00:12:18.080
Don't come near me!

00:12:18.080 --> 00:12:20.550
You are an enemy I must destroy!

00:12:20.550 --> 00:12:21.880
I won't let go!

00:12:21.880 --> 00:12:24.050
I'm not letting go this time!

00:12:24.550 --> 00:12:26.070
No matter what you become,

00:12:26.630 --> 00:12:28.720
or what happens to me!

00:12:29.030 --> 00:12:32.490
I'll save you as many times as I have to!

00:12:34.060 --> 00:12:36.500
As many times as I have to!

00:12:41.110 --> 00:12:43.700
<b>Rat</b>

00:13:03.770 --> 00:13:04.970
Chu-tan?

00:13:10.260 --> 00:13:11.140
I hate you.

00:13:12.270 --> 00:13:14.980
I really hate you, Nya-tan!

00:13:22.620 --> 00:13:23.360
Why?

00:13:23.780 --> 00:13:26.120
Why did you betray me?!

00:13:26.120 --> 00:13:28.670
I told you, I'm sorry!

00:13:28.670 --> 00:13:30.490
I... I wanted...

00:13:30.490 --> 00:13:32.410
to be

00:13:32.410 --> 00:13:35.370
with you!

00:13:38.750 --> 00:13:41.460
I thought you'd be by my 
side, supporting me.

00:13:41.460 --> 00:13:44.610
That's why I was able to tout 
my ideals and beliefs...

00:13:44.610 --> 00:13:46.340
Yet you just went wandering off,

00:13:46.340 --> 00:13:50.090
this way and that!

00:13:50.640 --> 00:13:53.640
The agreement was that I'd 
support you from the shadows!

00:13:54.220 --> 00:13:57.810
That's why I visited different worlds, 
nipping their problems in the bud!

00:13:58.050 --> 00:14:00.710
I thought that would make 
things better overall!

00:14:00.710 --> 00:14:02.690
Yeah, things were definitely balanced!

00:14:02.690 --> 00:14:03.570
Then it's fine!

00:14:03.570 --> 00:14:04.650
It's not fine!

00:14:04.650 --> 00:14:06.360
Why not?!

00:14:07.380 --> 00:14:09.160
The nation was balanced,

00:14:10.340 --> 00:14:12.160
but I was lonely!

00:14:13.110 --> 00:14:15.000
Because you weren't there!

00:14:18.180 --> 00:14:19.220
Wha...

00:14:21.020 --> 00:14:23.000
What're you acting all loving for?

00:14:23.310 --> 00:14:25.010
You can't say that now!

00:14:25.590 --> 00:14:27.030
It's throwing your character off!

00:14:27.030 --> 00:14:28.910
I-I know that!

00:14:28.910 --> 00:14:30.780
I know I'm way off...

00:14:32.010 --> 00:14:33.850
But... But...

00:14:34.380 --> 00:14:37.180
I couldn't say it for two thousand years!

00:14:37.770 --> 00:14:40.480
So why can't I say it now?!

00:14:41.310 --> 00:14:43.280
Both of their most precious secrets

00:14:43.280 --> 00:14:45.440
just came tumbling out.

00:14:46.390 --> 00:14:48.620
<i>I don't like who I am now, either!</i>

00:14:48.620 --> 00:14:50.950
<i>I'm pathetic, screaming 
and throwing tantrums...</i>

00:14:51.560 --> 00:14:53.490
<i>I don't know what to do anymore!</i>

00:14:54.730 --> 00:14:55.450
Um...

00:14:55.680 --> 00:14:58.100
Do you have your answer, human boy?

00:14:58.100 --> 00:15:00.460
I'm sorry, but could you move over?

00:15:00.460 --> 00:15:01.240
Huh?

00:15:01.240 --> 00:15:02.780
You're blocking the TV.

00:15:02.780 --> 00:15:04.590
Oh, right...

00:15:08.480 --> 00:15:10.380
I don't think you need to do anything.

00:15:10.380 --> 00:15:11.160
What?!

00:15:11.460 --> 00:15:14.320
You can be as out of character 
as you want, Chu-tan.

00:15:15.200 --> 00:15:17.780
That's what gives rise to 
all kinds of feelings.

00:15:17.150 --> 00:15:18.140
U-Um...

00:15:18.870 --> 00:15:21.440
You got too serious and 
went out of control,

00:15:21.440 --> 00:15:23.830
and you were finally able 
to say how you truly felt,

00:15:22.870 --> 00:15:24.150
Hello?

00:15:24.410 --> 00:15:26.900
all because you went out of character.

00:15:26.900 --> 00:15:28.400
What the...

00:15:28.720 --> 00:15:30.970
He's totally ignoring the manager.

00:15:30.970 --> 00:15:33.320
Th-That's amazing...

00:15:33.830 --> 00:15:34.620
Not bad.

00:15:35.210 --> 00:15:37.590
Being with Nya-tan made me understand.

00:15:38.750 --> 00:15:41.410
Because she screams, throws tantrums,

00:15:41.710 --> 00:15:45.340
and acts out of character, 
every day is more fun!

00:15:46.030 --> 00:15:49.490
I decided to support Nya-tan 
because that's who she is.

00:15:49.860 --> 00:15:50.770
And...

00:15:51.760 --> 00:15:53.860
I'll support you too, Chu-tan,

00:15:53.860 --> 00:15:56.310
because Nya-tan does!

00:16:07.420 --> 00:16:08.530
Both of you, go for it!

00:16:32.090 --> 00:16:35.260
<b>Rat</b>

00:16:41.340 --> 00:16:43.640
My chest... feels lighter...

00:16:45.590 --> 00:16:48.110
Takeru's Sol/Lull is really kind!

00:16:51.240 --> 00:16:52.230
I...

00:16:54.290 --> 00:16:55.370
I...

00:16:57.740 --> 00:16:59.760
I am Chu-tan of the rat clan,

00:17:00.080 --> 00:17:02.070
strongest of the Eto-shin!

00:17:06.070 --> 00:17:07.840
Okay, then once again...

00:17:08.640 --> 00:17:10.750
I'll defeat you and

00:17:11.090 --> 00:17:13.060
join the zodiac!

00:17:14.460 --> 00:17:16.720
Bring it on, Nya-tan!

00:17:21.430 --> 00:17:22.140
Shin...

00:17:22.140 --> 00:17:22.810
Super...

00:17:22.810 --> 00:17:23.480
...Tenchuu...

00:17:23.480 --> 00:17:24.140
...Cat...

00:17:24.140 --> 00:17:24.810
..Satsu!

00:17:24.810 --> 00:17:26.310
...Gun!

00:17:32.820 --> 00:17:36.070
<b>Over</b>

00:17:37.440 --> 00:17:38.140
Manager.

00:17:38.140 --> 00:17:39.780
Huh? Oh... Yes!

00:17:40.850 --> 00:17:42.830
What is it, human boy?

00:17:43.450 --> 00:17:44.830
Rat, Ox,

00:17:44.830 --> 00:17:47.210
Tiger, Rabbit, Dragon,

00:17:47.210 --> 00:17:49.590
Snake, Horse, Sheep,

00:17:49.590 --> 00:17:51.960
Monkey, Rooster, Dog,

00:17:52.240 --> 00:17:53.010
and Boar.

00:17:54.130 --> 00:17:56.940
You said they were all imperfect.

00:17:58.880 --> 00:18:00.050
They're great <i>because</i>

00:18:00.050 --> 00:18:03.090
they're imperfect, screaming, crying, 
out-of-character zodiac spirits.

00:18:03.490 --> 00:18:06.940
I do need the zodiac spirits.

00:18:08.440 --> 00:18:11.000
Human boy, I accept

00:18:11.000 --> 00:18:13.440
your words as complete truth.

00:18:14.310 --> 00:18:16.550
And thus...

00:18:18.940 --> 00:18:22.690
Article 0 of the Zodiac Precepts 
will not be invoked!

00:18:22.690 --> 00:18:23.950
Thank you!

00:18:24.210 --> 00:18:26.170
Whew, thank goodness!

00:18:26.170 --> 00:18:27.700
If the current zodiac spirits disappeared,

00:18:27.700 --> 00:18:30.750
I'd have to conduct job 
interviews all over again!

00:18:30.750 --> 00:18:31.210
Huh?

00:18:31.550 --> 00:18:34.320
Everyone! Tomorrow is a fun, fun payday!

00:18:34.320 --> 00:18:36.710
Make sure you come to work!

00:18:36.710 --> 00:18:39.640
Now... Adios!

00:18:41.540 --> 00:18:43.310
<i>The battle is over.</i>

00:18:44.720 --> 00:18:48.140
Hi again! I'm back!

00:18:47.090 --> 00:18:48.770
Welcome back, Nya-tan.

00:18:48.140 --> 00:18:49.200
Yay!

00:18:49.200 --> 00:18:51.110
Hey, that was just a fluke, you know.

00:18:51.110 --> 00:18:52.770
What?! It was not!

00:18:52.770 --> 00:18:53.520
Yeah, it was.

00:18:53.520 --> 00:18:55.320
Was not!

00:19:00.140 --> 00:19:02.450
Your Sol/Lull is calm now.

00:19:02.710 --> 00:19:05.660
But rest for a while just in case, okay?

00:19:05.960 --> 00:19:07.830
Th-Thanks.

00:19:08.090 --> 00:19:09.440
We were worried about you.

00:19:08.910 --> 00:19:11.040
So Nya-tan's Kagura Senguu

00:19:09.440 --> 00:19:10.580
Sorry...

00:19:11.040 --> 00:19:13.590
didn't destroy Chu-tan's Etotama.

00:19:13.590 --> 00:19:17.070
It's a technique to repair and purify it.

00:19:17.070 --> 00:19:19.300
A secret technique that can be 
either poison or medicine...

00:19:19.700 --> 00:19:21.700
Talk about an amazing ability.

00:19:22.660 --> 00:19:24.710
Wait! Wait, wait!

00:19:24.710 --> 00:19:26.090
What's wrong, Nya-tan?

00:19:26.090 --> 00:19:27.600
Don't give me that!

00:19:27.600 --> 00:19:29.470
Hand it over!

00:19:29.890 --> 00:19:31.060
Hand what over?

00:19:31.650 --> 00:19:39.280
<b>Seal</b>

00:19:32.420 --> 00:19:34.470
Your Sol/Lull Seal!

00:19:34.470 --> 00:19:35.880
Give me your Sol/Lull Seal!

00:19:35.880 --> 00:19:38.120
I won our Sol/Lull battle!

00:19:38.120 --> 00:19:39.280
Oh, right.

00:19:39.680 --> 00:19:41.940
That victory was a bit up in the air.

00:19:41.940 --> 00:19:42.830
Right on the edge.

00:19:42.830 --> 00:19:45.330
Like, if I had to say, I guess you won?

00:19:45.330 --> 00:19:46.700
A win is a win!

00:19:46.930 --> 00:19:49.250
Just hand it over already!

00:19:49.250 --> 00:19:51.870
I'm gonna join the zodiac 
and release Chu-tan from

00:19:51.870 --> 00:19:54.060
the pressure of being one of them!

00:19:54.060 --> 00:19:57.550
That's my ultimate goal!

00:19:58.390 --> 00:19:59.570
You can't have my Seal.

00:19:59.570 --> 00:20:00.630
Why the heck not?!

00:20:01.090 --> 00:20:04.140
I did something I can't undo.

00:20:07.220 --> 00:20:07.680
<b>Ox</b>

00:20:08.930 --> 00:20:09.900
But still...

00:20:10.400 --> 00:20:12.530
No, that's why...

00:20:12.530 --> 00:20:15.000
I want to fulfill my duty as a

00:20:15.000 --> 00:20:17.110
zodiac spirit and protect this land!

00:20:17.840 --> 00:20:19.400
That's wonderful!

00:20:19.400 --> 00:20:20.570
We'll help you.

00:20:20.570 --> 00:20:21.900
Wait a minute!

00:20:22.370 --> 00:20:25.840
Why don't we change the ETM12 
rules while we're at it?

00:20:25.840 --> 00:20:27.030
You're right.

00:20:27.030 --> 00:20:30.180
Shall we submit an amendment 
to the Zodiac Precepts?

00:20:31.050 --> 00:20:32.170
On that note,

00:20:32.170 --> 00:20:35.330
would you continue to help me, everyone?

00:20:36.970 --> 00:20:38.950
<i>Wh-What is this mood?!</i>

00:20:38.950 --> 00:20:41.720
<i>Does this mean I can't join the zodiac?!</i>

00:20:41.720 --> 00:20:43.760
<i>My one cour worth of effort...</i>

00:20:44.050 --> 00:20:45.290
Don't push yourself.

00:20:45.290 --> 00:20:48.680
You can live as you please, 
unbound by anything.

00:20:49.010 --> 00:20:50.890
I wasn't pushing myself...

00:20:50.890 --> 00:20:52.430
I'll do things my way,

00:20:52.880 --> 00:20:54.900
and you do things your way.

00:20:54.900 --> 00:20:56.440
And we'll protect this land together.

00:20:57.100 --> 00:20:57.940
Promise.

00:21:01.630 --> 00:21:02.820
No!

00:21:02.820 --> 00:21:05.330
This means I'm past my prime!

00:21:05.330 --> 00:21:06.790
I have no place here now!

00:21:06.790 --> 00:21:09.590
Demand my help more!

00:21:07.870 --> 00:21:09.910
I want you!

00:21:10.300 --> 00:21:11.970
My sweet Nya-tan!

00:21:11.970 --> 00:21:13.790
Huh?! Mo-tan?!

00:21:13.790 --> 00:21:16.130
Yes, it's me!

00:21:16.130 --> 00:21:17.650
How? How?!

00:21:17.650 --> 00:21:19.090
Before I knew it...

00:21:19.870 --> 00:21:21.590
I lived inside Chu-tan!

00:21:21.950 --> 00:21:23.980
You've been inside me all this time?

00:21:23.980 --> 00:21:24.880
In that moment...

00:21:25.500 --> 00:21:27.930
My Etotama touched Chu-tan,

00:21:27.930 --> 00:21:30.300
and we were connected a tiny bit.

00:21:30.300 --> 00:21:34.170
But, of course, that wasn't 
enough to change anything...

00:21:34.520 --> 00:21:37.500
But Chu-tan and Nya-tan, your love

00:21:37.500 --> 00:21:40.520
aided my reincarnation!

00:21:41.510 --> 00:21:42.610
That's great.

00:21:44.270 --> 00:21:45.230
I see...

00:21:45.790 --> 00:21:49.360
You've all been beside me this whole time.

00:21:50.680 --> 00:21:53.060
I'm sorry I didn't notice.

00:21:54.250 --> 00:21:55.240
Thank you.

00:21:57.010 --> 00:21:59.420
What just happened here?

00:21:59.680 --> 00:22:02.420
Is this the end? Seriously?!

00:22:02.420 --> 00:22:05.810
Nya-tan, now there's 
nothing tying you down.

00:22:05.810 --> 00:22:07.050
You're free.

00:22:07.050 --> 00:22:09.440
Ya can wander off on journeys again now.

00:22:09.440 --> 00:22:10.430
Yep, yep.

00:22:11.240 --> 00:22:13.430
Well, anyway, that's great, huh?

00:22:13.430 --> 00:22:14.300
I—

00:22:14.670 --> 00:22:17.650
It is not!

00:23:40.290 --> 00:23:42.970
Nya-tan, let's go!

00:23:42.970 --> 00:23:44.320
All right!

00:23:45.000 --> 00:23:46.900
Have a battle with me!

00:23:48.150 --> 00:23:50.030
<b>Etotama</b>

00:23:50.030 --> 00:23:54.020
<b>Thank you for watching!!!</b>

00:23:50.030 --> 00:23:54.020
<b>See you
 later!!</b>

00:23:50.030 --> 00:23:54.020
<b>Thanks for all 
the Sol/Lull!</b>

00:23:50.030 --> 00:23:54.020
<b>End</b>

00:23:50.030 --> 00:23:54.020
